Z||000003||Phaeton||01-30-2000||12:30 AM||||GM sells 5 oz spray touch up paint, the plenum is standard red or bright red, the dealer has a hot line to confirm for sure which it is, try not to pick on them if its crowded as it takes awhile (ten to fifteen mins) to get through and get answer.||||reg||1
